{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_047530","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"听说UFO也会绑架人。就是因希尔夫妇事件而出名的那种“Abduction”。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":90,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"所以我第一次看到Colibrí时，还以为那是UFO。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":59,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"是他们的Fulton回收吗。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":30,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"他们肯定和外星人联手了。虽然他们没让我见到外星人……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":81,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"要是被抓住，可会被拿去做人体实验哦？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":54,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"那也比拷问强……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":27,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"不过，外星人到底长什么样？果然是灰色皮肤、没有头发，连瞳孔都没有吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":102,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"还是说身高<R=4瓦拉,3m>，还穿着裙子？","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=4瓦拉,3m>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":50,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"不会吧……。不过，那种兵器的动作确实是我从没见过的。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":78,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"CIA真的和他们接触过吗……？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":39,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"对啊！一定是这样！","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":27,"review_flag":""}]}